      "id": "emergent_ai_winter_signals",
      "description": "Multiple frontier labs announce restructuring amid declining private investment and growing regulatory uncertainty. Venture funding for generative AI startups drops sharply, and several high-profile AI products are discontinued due to poor adoption or unmanageable risk. These signals suggest a possible 'AI winter' is forming, driven by overhype, safety failures, and diminishing returns at the frontier.",
